cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: >-
  fedefl-build-bw25: an open USLCI · FEDEFL · TRACI 2.2 life-cycle
  assessment pipeline for brightway25
abstract: >-
  A fast, fully-open, programmable life-cycle assessment pipeline in
  Python. It loads the open, EPA-aligned US data stack (USLCI background
  processes, FEDEFL elementary flows, TRACI 2.2 impact methods) into
  brightway25 via a custom openLCA JSON-LD parser, with the engine
  verified against openLCA to within 5% on identical inputs across four
  locked test cases (engine parity, not certification of study results).
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Watson
    given-names: Harrison
repository-code: 'https://github.com/hotatejunior/fedefl-build-bw25'
license: MIT
keywords:
  - life-cycle assessment
  - LCA
  - brightway
  - brightway25
  - USLCI
  - FEDEFL
  - TRACI
  - openLCA
  - reproducible research
